    - Code: en
      Text: Drag to Move Jellies
    - Code: tr
      Text: "J\xF6leyi onu bekleyen kap\u0131ya s\xFCr\xFCkle!"
  - Key: tutorial.level2.step1
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Move Jellies Next to Each Other to Merge Them
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Ayn\u0131 renk j\xF6leleri birle\u015Ftirip kap\u0131n\u0131n istedi\u011Fi
        \u015Fekli yap!"
  - Key: tutorial.level2.step2
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Move the New Jelly to the Gate
    - Code: tr
      Text: "\u015Eimdi yeni \u015Fekli kap\u0131s\u0131na g\xF6t\xFCr!"
