      Text: New booster unlocked!
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Yeni g\xFC\xE7lendirici a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131!"
  - Key: info.booster.rocket.title
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Rocket
    - Code: tr
      Text: Roket
  - Key: info.booster.rocket.description
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'Tap a door: the jellies it waits for are taken away.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bir kap\u0131ya dokun: bekledi\u011Fi j\xF6leler yok olsun."
  - Key: info.booster.freezetime.title
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Freeze Time
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Zaman\u0131 Dondur"
  - Key: info.booster.freezetime.description
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: Stops the clock for a while, so you can think.
    - Code: tr
      Text: "S\xFCreyi bir s\xFCreli\u011Fine durdurur, d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmeye vaktin
        olur."
  - Key: info.booster.ufo.title
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: UFO
    - Code: tr
      Text: UFO
  - Key: info.booster.ufo.description
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: 'Tap a jelly: every jelly of its colour is taken away.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Bir j\xF6leye dokun: o renkteki t\xFCm j\xF6leler yok olsun."
  - Key: gameplay.booster_hint.ufo_frozen
    Translations:
    - Code: en
      Text: "A frozen jelly or door still needs this colour. Pick another one."
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Donmu\u015F bir j\u00F6le ya da kap\u0131 bu renge h\u00E2l\u00E2 ihtiya\u00E7 duyuyor. Ba\u015Fka bir renk se\u00E7."
  - Key: gameplay.difficulty.hard
    Translations:
    - Code: en
